      "description": "Create a useful Colombian dealer demonstration that separates product handling, approved installation guidance and sales claims.",
      "lead": "A Colombian distributor can improve the quality of dealer conversations by demonstrating how a PVC panel system is identified and assembled. However, a quick showroom demonstration should not become an improvised installation standard. The useful training session shows what buyers need to check and which questions must go back to the supplier or qualified installer.",
