      "closing": "Send Luvie the reception desk elevations, preferred pattern and required sheet quantities. Ask for the relevant UV-sheet information and available edge options before finalising the fabrication scope. Contact globalsales@luvieindustry.com or WhatsApp +86 19005833027 at https://wa.me/8619005833027.",
