      "lead": "A boutique hospitality project can use several similar timber-look finishes in a small number of rooms. For an Oman buyer, the challenge is keeping the intended WPC profile, colour and junction details consistent across the reception, guest areas and service spaces. A material schedule should make these distinctions visible before purchase. It should not group every warm brown panel under one decorative description and leave the installer to interpret the design.",
